# MODULE COCK owned six cell BF in BF interpreter kernel
# PURPOSE execute guest source commands as data under the basic BF instruction set
# INPUT chunks with positive byte count then that many source instruction bytes
# INPUT terminate program input with a zero count then supply guest data bytes
# OUTPUT raw guest output bytes in original order
# TAPE each instruction record uses twelve host cells
# TAPE first cell is temporary flag and second cell is original opcode
# TAPE six guest data cells follow along with guest pointer scratch bracket depth and loader marker
# PROFILE guest tape supports exactly six data cells in this diagnostic development prototype
# PROFILE guest pointer must stay within positions zero through five for defined operation
# LIMITATION no guest trap status or execution fuel accounting yet
# LIMITATION source closure and source syntax preflight remain outside this kernel
# ALGORITHM copy guest cell state between instruction records when advancing program position
# ALGORITHM scan brackets in either direction using a nested loop depth counter

# Load all chunked source records
,[[>,<-[->>>>>>>>>>>>+<<<<<<<<<<<<]>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>+<<<<<<<<<<<],]

# Rewind to first source instruction
>>>>>>>>>>>[<<<<<<<<<<<<]<<<<<<<<<<<

